stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Connecting
    Connecting --> Resynchronising: socket open, join and sync
    Resynchronising --> Live: final sync chunk applied
    Live --> Offline: offline or socket close
    Resynchronising --> Offline: offline or socket close
    Connecting --> Offline: connection fails
    Offline --> Connecting: online or reconnect backoff
    Live --> Resynchronising: unseen ack or access check unavailable
    Resynchronising --> Connecting: SNAPSHOT_REQUIRED, reopen snapshot
    Live --> Recovering: stale anchor or replica conflict
    Resynchronising --> Recovering: stale anchor or replica conflict
    Recovering --> Connecting: private recovered draft saved, reopen original
    Recovering --> Offline: recovery fails, local backup retained
    note right of Offline
        Cached document can reopen offline.
        Account and actor lock gate editing.
        Unsent operations remain in IndexedDB.
    end note
